    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1755196623\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Free Roam Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available from the very start of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quests, no enemies, no horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just atmosphere, exploration, and a sense of solitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the world without fear \u2014 and savor the details.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/43b16ef768cf149d645a732ddd300dcb.poster.avif?t=1755196623\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/43b16ef768cf149d645a732ddd300dcb.webm?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/43b16ef768cf149d645a732ddd300dcb.mp4?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udfac <strong>Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey where you face your traumas and sink into darkness while searching for the truth\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, you complete objectives to piece together fragments of the character\u2019s past.<br>Every step holds a memory, every light hides a truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hid to forget\u2026<br>But now, it\u2019s time to face it. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/f0b4a158ae5e6113e395f2fa2217bc2f.poster.avif?t=1755196623\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/f0b4a158ae5e6113e395f2fa2217bc2f.webm?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/f0b4a158ae5e6113e395f2fa2217bc2f.mp4?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br> \ud83c\udfac <strong>Atmospheric Intro Scene</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The door opens\u2026 Reality fades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a room. It\u2019s a memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t trust what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail is a trace, every shadow a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peace you wouldn't want to enter.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/bdcc28b2132d595f01a4e364386d776b.poster.avif?t=1755196623\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/bdcc28b2132d595f01a4e364386d776b.webm?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/bdcc28b2132d595f01a4e364386d776b.mp4?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A blinding light opens the path to a forgotten memory. But are you ready to face it?</strong><br><br>This is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rest of the story is waiting for <strong>you</strong> to uncover it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to confront the past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey into the depths of your mind is just beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping reality is easy\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But returning isn\u2019t always possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can discover what awaits in the forgotten rooms.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1755196623\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Free Roam Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available from the very start of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No quests, no enemies, no horror elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just atmosphere, exploration, and a sense of solitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the world without fear \u2014 and savor the details.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/43b16ef768cf149d645a732ddd300dcb.poster.avif?t=1755196623\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/43b16ef768cf149d645a732ddd300dcb.webm?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/43b16ef768cf149d645a732ddd300dcb.mp4?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udfac <strong>Story Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A journey where you face your traumas and sink into darkness while searching for the truth\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, you complete objectives to piece together fragments of the character\u2019s past.<br>Every step holds a memory, every light hides a truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You hid to forget\u2026<br>But now, it\u2019s time to face it. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/f0b4a158ae5e6113e395f2fa2217bc2f.poster.avif?t=1755196623\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/f0b4a158ae5e6113e395f2fa2217bc2f.webm?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/f0b4a158ae5e6113e395f2fa2217bc2f.mp4?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br> \ud83c\udfac <strong>Atmospheric Intro Scene</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The door opens\u2026 Reality fades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a room. It\u2019s a memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t trust what you see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail is a trace, every shadow a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A peace you wouldn't want to enter.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/bdcc28b2132d595f01a4e364386d776b.poster.avif?t=1755196623\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/bdcc28b2132d595f01a4e364386d776b.webm?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3586910/extras/bdcc28b2132d595f01a4e364386d776b.mp4?t=1755196623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A blinding light opens the path to a forgotten memory. But are you ready to face it?</strong><br><br>This is only the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rest of the story is waiting for <strong>you</strong> to uncover it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to confront the past?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey into the depths of your mind is just beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping reality is easy\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But returning isn\u2019t always possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only you can discover what awaits in the forgotten rooms.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Forgotten Rooms is a psychological exploration game about a character diagnosed with schizophrenia who struggles with his traumas. He escapes reality with medication and confronts his past in the imaginary world of \u201cpoolrooms\u201d..",
